---
interface Props { title?: string; }
const { title = 'Start small. Keep it local.' } = Astro.props;
---
<aside class="fk-callout" aria-label={title}>
  <h3>{title}</h3>
  <p>Use sample records. Run one tool first. Do not expose the lab to the public internet.</p>
  <p>Before production: assign an owner, apply updates, secure access, and test a restore.</p>
  <slot />
</aside>
